WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.680
Watch and read: For your labels practice, choose a describing word for the mango.

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:09.907
The answer is: yellow. A describing word tells us more about an object.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:15.050
Watch and read: For your labels practice, which group does a mango belong to?

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:20.283
The answer is: fruit. Group objects by what they are or what they are used for.
